# Git Policy — Commit OK, Push Blocked (Always)

## Rules
- Allowed: status/diff/add/commit/checkout -b/merge
- Forbidden: git push (blocked), changing remotes, credential helpers.

## Push bypass for human operator
- Bash: `ALLOW_GIT_PUSH=1 git push`
- PowerShell: `$env:ALLOW_GIT_PUSH=1; git push`

## Implementation
- `.githooks/pre-push`
- `git config core.hooksPath .githooks`

## Quality Gates
- Перед коммитом: минимальные проверки (линтер/тесты если есть).
